  startNode: 0
  nodes:
  - message: I'm at the shed.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 1
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  - message: Where are you?
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 2
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 300, y: 0}
  - message: 
    isPlayer: 1
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies:
    - replyText: "I\u2019m sitting inside on the bench. You're here already?"
      nextNode: 3
    - replyText: "No way. I\u2019m looking around right now, and there\u2019s no
        one."
      nextNode: 4
    nextNode: 0
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 600, y: 0}
  - message: "I\u2019m standing right in front of that bench. There\u2019s no one
      here."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 5
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 900, y: 0}
  - message: I don't see you either. The shed is completely empty. Just a single
      light.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 5
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 900, y: 130}
  - message: Listen, let me finish what my uncle told me.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 6
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1200, y: 0}
  - message: "That woman was named Paeng. Years ago, she was waiting for a bus at
      this shed when she got sent a set of rules\u2014just like you did."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 7
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1500, y: 0}
  - message: A stranger was there with her that night. They both followed the rules
      together and almost made it to the end.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 8
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1800, y: 0}
  - message: But the last bus could only take one person.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 9
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2100, y: 0}
  - message: By morning, the shed was empty. Paeng vanished, and while the guy made
      it home... no one ever saw him again.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 10
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2400, y: 0}
  - message: My grandma said ever since then, anyone who wanders into that shed receives
      texts from an unknown number.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 11
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2700, y: 0}
  - message: Bro...
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 12
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3000, y: 0}
  - message: The person texting you... my uncle thinks it might be the guy who survived
      that night
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 13
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3300, y: 0}
  - message: "He\u2019s not trying to help you. He\u2019s trying to find someone
      to take his place."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 14
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3600, y: 0}
  - message: My uncle said Paeng never actually killed anyone.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 15
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3900, y: 0}
  - message: Everyone who died there was consumed by their own fear.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 16
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 4200, y: 0}
  - message: 
    isPlayer: 1
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies:
    - replyText: So what am I supposed to do now?!
      nextNode: 17
    - replyText: "Wait... so I\u2019ve been following his orders this whole time?"
      nextNode: 18
    nextNode: 0
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 4500, y: 0}
  - message: I don't know. My uncle only said...
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 19
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 4800, y: 0}
  - message: "Yeah. But it\u2019s not too late. My uncle said..."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 19
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 4800, y: 130}
  - message: '"DO NOT get on the bus he tells you to get on."'
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 20
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 5100, y: 0}
  - message: "I\u2019ll wait right here until you get out."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 21
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 5400, y: 0}
  - message: '[Ton went offline]'
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 22
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 5700, y: 0}
  - message: '[A few seconds later, a chat from an unknown sender popped up]'
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 23
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 6000, y: 0}
  - message: "[Unknown: Your friend talks too much.]\t"
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: -1
